<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in tonnes 66 Brix for Oct 28-Nov 3 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		Oct 28-Nov 3  Oct 30-Nov 5	TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>			1996	  1995	    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Stocks/open    436,186.6   296,242.0</p>
<p> Production	34,393.3    34,977.0     667,418.2   468,683.6</p>
<p> Shipment	  27,571.0    18,976.7     388,875.1   303,512.1</p>
<p> Home Market	  302.5	 388.7	 5,284.5     7,368.0</p>
<p> Stocks/close   442,706.4   311,853.6</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
